Create a simple Hollowtide Effect Sheet Generator review page showing the ORIGINAL linked image untouched, contain fit and CSS image-rendering: pixelated. No crop, recolor, filter, halo or resampling. Keep the magenta background visible and display the full supplied move brief. Label candidate. For MODE MODULES show intended main shape, impact and three motifs without inventing frame order. For MODE ACTION show intended row-major F0-F7 material sequence and note that actual release/impact timing is chosen after per-frame inspection; do not assume every sheet plays directly at fixed fps. Creature action and target effects remain separate. Never redraw the sheet or invent measured palette counts, successful checks, transparency, exact exported resolution, rigging or automatic Godot import. Offer Open original only with the actual linked image URL; no fake downloads or webpage-screenshot export. Quiet readable river-ink/bone UI with no image glow.

